to report the tactical oopsies we definitely intended to include.There’s also a blog-sorry, an official propaganda feed-where we’ll post updates on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T09:49:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357037853","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3239850-1838407329268773","game_id":"steam-3239850","kind":"announcement","title":"Humanity Is Cooked. Culture Warz: Tactics Is Coming Soon.","summary":"So, here’s the situation.A global conspiracy weaponized social media and turned almost everyone into a mindless NPC. The timelines are cursed. The dialogue loops are getting worse. Somewhere, somebody is still typing “Well, actually…”The vibes remain terrible.Humanity’s last hope is an “elite” resistance force of Chads, a collection of glorified signal blockers called Jammers, and you-the tactical genius who was apparently available.Culture Warz: Tactics is a grid-based, turn-based strategy game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T11:20:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329268773","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3239850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3239850":"2026-10-26T00:23:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3239850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4998300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id"